## Design Goal

The project is intentionally built in layers:

```text
Log
 ↓
Partition
 ↓
Topic
 ↓
Broker
 ↓
Consumer Groups
 ↓
Replication
 ↓
Multiple Brokers
 ↓
Scaling & Failure Recovery
```

Each layer is implemented and tested before adding the next one.

The primary goal is to understand the distributed-systems concepts behind Kafka rather than simply reproduce Kafka's API.
